@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam BorderColor #334155
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam NoteBorderColor #B6A16C
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
title UC-05  Program Head oversight
' Requirements: PERM-03 PERM-04 CONTENT-01 CONTENT-02 CONTENT-03 CONTENT-04 CONTENT-05 CONTENT-06 CONTENT-07 CONTENT-08 PATH-01 PATH-02 PATH-03 ASSESS-01 ASSESS-02 ASSESS-03 ASSESS-04 ASSESS-05 REPORT-01 REPORT-02 NOTICE-01 P-07
left to right direction
actor "Program Head" as A
rectangle "CS-GAMUERS: academic oversight" {
  usecase "Review course, career-path,\nand assessment submissions" as U0
  usecase "Approve publication or revision" as U1
  usecase "Request changes or reject\nwith a reason" as U2
  usecase "Approve course/path retirement" as U3
  usecase "Transfer content ownership\nand assign assessment owner" as U4
  usecase "View aggregate participation,\ncompletion, and quiz reports" as U5
}
A -- U0
A -- U1
A -- U2
A -- U3
A -- U4
A -- U5
note bottom of A
Oversight only: no course authoring.
Reports may be filtered by course, revision, and dates.
Small-group protection applies below five students.
No individual records or private conversations.
end note
footer CS-GAMUERS | UC-05 | Product behavior
@enduml
